sequenceDiagram
    actor R as Requester
    participant App as Browser app
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Order as Order Service
    participant Kafka as Kafka
    participant Rating as Rating Service

    R->>App: Acknowledge receipt on /orders/{id}
    App->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/acknowledge
    GW->>Order: authorize, forward
    Order-->>App: Acknowledged
    App->>GW: GET /api/v1/credit/me/balance
    Order-)Kafka: rating.permission.granted, from Order's outbox
    Kafka-)Rating: grant stored
    loop after 1.5, 4 and 10 seconds, then every 30 seconds
        App->>GW: GET /api/v1/rating/me/pending
        GW->>Rating: authorize, forward
        Rating-->>App: pending grants
    end
    Note over App: prompt opens by itself at most once per tab session
    alt Submit
        App->>GW: POST /api/v1/rating/orders/{id}, score and comment
        Rating-->>App: 201
    else Skip
        App->>GW: POST /api/v1/rating/orders/{id}/skip
        Rating-->>App: 204, gone from pending on every device
        Note over App: if that call fails, the skip is kept in localStorage
    end
